Subject: [PATCH 030/144] GreatDANE: about:dane-discover follows the node's
 dane-09 /gd/names contract

Object rows with owner_h160 (null = unowned), offset/total paging with Prev/Next,
503 no_db shown as syncing, truncated surfaced, malformed rows dropped.
run_gd_discover.py: mock-node tests for paging, no_db, truncated, null owner.
