- * unfiltered view asks once per first character. Generated in the parent,
+ * dane-09 contract: GET /gd/names?prefix=&offset=&limit= ->
+ * {tld,status,prefix,names:[{name,owner_h160|null,lease_expiry,state,price}],
+ *  total,offset,limit,count,truncated}; 400 bad_*, 503 no_db. An empty prefix
